---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Skill Foundry | Practical AI Skills">
  <section class="page-heading"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p><h1>Learn AI by building.</h1><p>Skill Foundry is a practical learning resource for people who want useful AI skills, prompts and workflows without unnecessary complexity.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow article-content">
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <p>Every resource is designed to be useful on its own: understand the idea, see the tutorial, copy the prompt and try it yourself.</p>
    <p>The site is built as a growing library, so each tutorial can have its own shareable resource page and search-friendly URL.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
